2025-10-04 19:58:14,970 - DEBUG - chunk: b'data: {"id":"4c5d52e4-6e50-42da-9041-b9f9c9e5dc95","jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"contextId":"60c9dc65-b5d9-41bb-8946-741c95d3401e","final":false,"kind":"status-update","status":{"message":{"kind":"message","messageId":"e32829fb-fd49-4489-a4d6-6ee95192f128","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"D\xe1\xbb\xb1a tr\xc3\xaan c\xc3\xa1c tri\xe1\xbb\x87u ch\xe1\xbb\xa9ng b\xe1\xba\xa1n m\xc3\xb4 t\xe1\xba\xa3 (\xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa7y b\xe1\xbb\xa5ng, kh\xc3\xb3 ti\xc3\xaau, bu\xe1\xbb\x93n n\xc3\xb4n), c\xc3\xb3 m\xe1\xbb\x99t s\xe1\xbb\x91 b\xe1\xbb\x87nh c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 li\xc3\xaan quan. Tuy nhi\xc3\xaan, t\xc3\xb4i c\xe1\xba\xa7n th\xc3\xaam th\xc3\xb4ng tin \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0a ra k\xe1\xba\xbft lu\xe1\xba\xadn ch\xc3\xadnh x\xc3\xa1c.\\n\\n**1. C\xc3\xa1c b\xe1\xbb\x87nh c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 li\xc3\xaan quan:**\\n\\n*   **Kh\xc3\xb3 ti\xc3\xaau ch\xe1\xbb\xa9c n\xc4\x83ng:** R\xe1\xbb\x91i lo\xe1\xba\xa1n ti\xc3\xaau h\xc3\xb3a g\xc3\xa2y kh\xc3\xb3 ch\xe1\xbb\x8bu v\xc3\xb9ng b\xe1\xbb\xa5ng tr\xc3\xaan, \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa7y h\xc6\xa1i, bu\xe1\xbb\x93n n\xc3\xb4n.\\n*   **(C\xc3\xa1c b\xe1\xbb\x87nh kh\xc3\xa1c):** C\xe1\xba\xa7n th\xc3\xaam th\xc3\xb4ng tin \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 x\xc3\xa1c \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x8bnh c\xc3\xa1c b\xe1\xbb\x87nh ti\xe1\xbb\x81m n\xc4\x83ng kh\xc3\xa1c.\\n\\n**2. \xc4\x90\xe1\xbb\x81 xu\xe1\xba\xa5t chuy\xc3\xaan khoa v\xc3\xa0 g\xc3\xb3i d\xe1\xbb\x8bch v\xe1\xbb\xa5:**\\n\\nDo c\xc3\xa1c tri\xe1\xbb\x87u ch\xe1\xbb\xa9ng c\xe1\xbb\xa7a b\xe1\xba\xa1n li\xc3\xaan quan \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xbfn ti\xc3\xaau h\xc3\xb3a, b\xe1\xba\xa1n c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 tham kh\xe1\xba\xa3o c\xc3\xa1c g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m sau:\\n\\n*   **Ti\xc3\xaau h\xc3\xb3a:**\\n    *   G\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m t\xe1\xbb\x95ng qu\xc3\xa1t cao c\xe1\xba\xa5p \xe2\x80\x94 17,000,000 VND \xe2\x80\x94 relevance\\\\_score: 0.47\\n    *   G\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m t\xe1\xba\xa7m so\xc3\xa1t b\xe1\xbb\x87nh l\xc3\xbd \xe1\xbb\x91ng ti\xc3\xaau h\xc3\xb3a c\xc3\xb3 can thi\xe1\xbb\x87p \xe2\x80\x94 3,500,000 VND \xe2\x80\x94 relevance\\\\_score: 0.41\\n\\n**3. L\xe1\xbb\x9di khuy\xc3\xaan v\xe1\xbb\x81 chi ph\xc3\xad:**\\n\\nKh\xc3\xb4ng t\xc3\xacm th\xe1\xba\xa5y g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m ph\xc3\xb9 h\xe1\xbb\xa3p v\xe1\xbb\x9bi b\xe1\xbb\x87nh n\xc3\xa0y d\xe1\xbb\xb1a tr\xc3\xaan d\xe1\xbb\xaf li\xe1\xbb\x87u hi\xe1\xbb\x87n c\xc3\xb3. V\xc3\xac relevance score c\xe1\xbb\xa7a c\xc3\xa1c g\xc3\xb3i \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x81u d\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9bi 0.7, b\xe1\xba\xa1n n\xc3\xaan nh\xe1\xba\xadp l\xe1\xba\xa1i \xc4\x91\xc3\xbang t\xc3\xaan b\xe1\xbb\x87nh nh\xc6\xb0 \xc4\x91\xc3\xa3 \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\xa3c d\xe1\xbb\xb1 \xc4\x91o\xc3\xa1n \xe1\xbb\x9f ph\xc3\xada tr\xc3\xaan (v\xc3\xad d\xe1\xbb\xa5: \'Kh\xc3\xb3 ti\xc3\xaau ch\xe1\xbb\xa9c n\xc4\x83ng\') \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 t\xc3\xb4i d\xc3\xb2 g\xc3\xb3i v\xc3\xa0 gi\xc3\xa1 ch\xc3\xadnh x\xc3\xa1c.\\n"}],"role":"agent"},"state":"working","timestamp":"2025-10-04T12:58:14.963835+00:00"},"taskId":"410286df-dbad-48a3-acaa-33fae31217e1"}}\r\n\r\n'
