x9fng \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xbfn b\xe1\xba\xa5t k\xe1\xbb\xb3 ph\xe1\xba\xa7n n\xc3\xa0o c\xe1\xbb\xa7a \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng ti\xc3\xaau h\xc3\xb3a.\\n    3. **Nhi\xe1\xbb\x85m tr\xc3\xb9ng \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng ru\xe1\xbb\x99t:** T\xc3\xacnh tr\xe1\xba\xa1ng nhi\xe1\xbb\x85m tr\xc3\xb9ng g\xc3\xa2y vi\xc3\xaam \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng ti\xc3\xaau h\xc3\xb3a, th\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng do vi khu\xe1\xba\xa9n, virus ho\xe1\xba\xb7c k\xc3\xbd sinh tr\xc3\xb9ng.\\n    4. **Tr\xc4\xa9:** C\xc3\xa1c t\xc4\xa9nh m\xe1\xba\xa1ch b\xe1\xbb\x8b s\xc6\xb0ng \xe1\xbb\x9f h\xe1\xba\xadu m\xc3\xb4n v\xc3\xa0 tr\xe1\xbb\xb1c tr\xc3\xa0ng d\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9bi, c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 g\xc3\xa2y ch\xe1\xba\xa3y m\xc3\xa1u v\xc3\xa0 \xc4\x91au.\\n    5. **N\xe1\xbb\xa9t h\xe1\xba\xadu m\xc3\xb4n:** V\xe1\xba\xbft r\xc3\xa1ch nh\xe1\xbb\x8f \xe1\xbb\x9f ni\xc3\xaam m\xe1\xba\xa1c h\xe1\xba\xadu m\xc3\xb4n, th\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng g\xc3\xa2y \xc4\x91au khi \xc4\x91i ti\xc3\xaau.\\n    6. **Ung th\xc6\xb0 \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa1i tr\xe1\xbb\xb1c tr\xc3\xa0ng:** S\xe1\xbb\xb1 ph\xc3\xa1t tri\xe1\xbb\x83n b\xe1\xba\xa5t th\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng c\xe1\xbb\xa7a c\xc3\xa1c t\xe1\xba\xbf b\xc3\xa0o trong \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa1i tr\xc3\xa0ng ho\xe1\xba\xb7c tr\xe1\xbb\xb1c tr\xc3\xa0ng.\\n\\n2. **\xc4\x90\xe1\xbb\x81 xu\xe1\xba\xa5t chuy\xc3\xaan khoa v\xc3\xa0 g\xc3\xb3i d\xe1\xbb\x8bch v\xe1\xbb\xa5:**\\nKh\xc3\xb4ng t\xc3\xacm th\xe1\xba\xa5y g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m ph\xc3\xb9 h\xe1\xbb\xa3p v\xe1\xbb\x9bi b\xe1\xbb\x87nh n\xc3\xa0y d\xe1\xbb\xb1a tr\xc3\xaan d\xe1\xbb\xaf li\xe1\xbb\x87u hi\xe1\xbb\x87n c\xc3\xb3.\\n\\n3. **L\xe1\xbb\x9di khuy\xc3\xaan v\xe1\xbb\x81 chi ph\xc3\xad:**\\nKh\xc3\xb4ng c\xc3\xb3 g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m ph\xc3\xb9 h\xe1\xbb\xa3p v\xe1\xbb\x9bi b\xe1\xbb\x87nh \'Vi\xc3\xaam lo\xc3\xa9t \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa1i tr\xc3\xa0ng\' (ho\xe1\xba\xb7c kh\xc3\xb4ng \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\xa7 t\xc6\xb0\xc6\xa1ng \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x93ng). Vui l\xc3\xb2ng nh\xe1\xba\xad