2025-10-06 16:00:23,713 - DEBUG - chunk: b'data: {"id":"dcdb2b2f-1557-494a-a9c3-a52b7c1474a0","jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"contextId":"ef4220a8-f9c5-49c5-b53e-a9f3a203ef09","final":false,"kind":"status-update","status":{"message":{"kind":"message","messageId":"0b2e50b8-4d8e-4230-96a5-71d3030a91f5","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"T\xc3\xb4i hi\xe1\xbb\x83u, b\xe1\xba\xa1n mu\xe1\xbb\x91n t\xc3\xacm c\xc3\xa1c g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m cho b\xe1\xbb\x87nh vi\xc3\xaam gan virus c\xe1\xba\xa5p t\xc3\xadnh v\xc3\xa0 vi\xc3\xaam gan do r\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\xa3u. \xc4\x90\xe1\xbb\x83 cung c\xe1\xba\xa5p th\xc3\xb4ng tin ch\xc3\xadnh x\xc3\xa1c nh\xe1\xba\xa5t, t\xc3\xb4i c\xe1\xba\xa7n b\xe1\xba\xa1n cung c\xe1\xba\xa5p th\xc3\xaam th\xc3\xb4ng tin chi ti\xe1\xba\xbft.\\n\\nVui l\xc3\xb2ng cho bi\xe1\xba\xbft b\xe1\xba\xa1n \xc4\x91\xc3\xa3 \xc4\x91i kh\xc3\xa1m v\xc3\xa0 c\xc3\xb3 danh s\xc3\xa1ch b\xe1\xbb\x87nh t\xe1\xbb\xab b\xc3\xa1c s\xc4\xa9 hay ch\xc6\xb0a? N\xe1\xba\xbfu c\xc3\xb3, vui l\xc3\xb2ng cung c\xe1\xba\xa5p th\xc3\xb4ng tin n\xc3\xa0y \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 t\xc3\xb4i c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 t\xc3\xacm ki\xe1\xba\xbfm c\xc3\xa1c g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m ph\xc3\xb9 h\xe1\xbb\xa3p.\\n\\nTrong tr\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng h\xe1\xbb\xa3p b\xe1\xba\xa1n ch\xc6\xb0a \xc4\x91i kh\xc3\xa1m, t\xc3\xb4i v\xe1\xba\xabn c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 cung c\xe1\xba\xa5p th\xc3\xb4ng tin v\xe1\xbb\x81 c\xc3\xa1c g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m b\xe1\xbb\x87nh vi\xc3\xaam gan virus c\xe1\xba\xa5p t\xc3\xadnh v\xc3\xa0 vi\xc3\xaam gan do r\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\xa3u d\xe1\xbb\xb1a tr\xc3\xaan th\xc3\xb4ng tin b\xe1\xba\xa1n cung c\xe1\xba\xa5p. Tuy nhi\xc3\xaan, \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa3m b\xe1\xba\xa3o k\xe1\xba\xbft qu\xe1\xba\xa3 ch\xc3\xadnh x\xc3\xa1c nh\xe1\xba\xa5t, t\xc3\xb4i khuy\xe1\xba\xbfn kh\xc3\xadch b\xe1\xba\xa1n n\xc3\xaan \xc4\x91i kh\xc3\xa1m b\xc3\xa1c s\xc4\xa9 \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\xa3c ch\xe1\xba\xa9n \xc4\x91o\xc3\xa1n v\xc3\xa0 t\xc6\xb0 v\