2025-10-07 13:01:58,741 - DEBUG - chunk: b'data: {"id":"d7983486-12e8-4239-bfb3-b39cc2cb47e5","jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"contextId":"487a119f-f615-4e3f-a724-b005619194ff","final":false,"kind":"status-update","status":{"message":{"kind":"message","messageId":"aa43c9b5-23d5-4d19-9b8f-bd4aead4853c","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"D\xe1\xbb\xb1a tr\xc3\xaan c\xc3\xa1c tri\xe1\xbb\x87u ch\xe1\xbb\xa9ng b\xe1\xba\xa1n m\xc3\xb4 t\xe1\xba\xa3 (\xc4\x91au \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa7u, ch\xc3\xb3ng m\xe1\xba\xb7t, t\xc3\xaa tay ch\xc3\xa2n), c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 b\xe1\xba\xa1n \xc4\x91ang g\xe1\xba\xb7p c\xc3\xa1c v\xe1\xba\xa5n \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x81 sau:\\n\\n1.  **R\xe1\xbb\x91i lo\xe1\xba\xa1n ti\xe1\xbb\x81n \xc4\x91\xc3\xacnh:** G\xc3\xa2y ch\xc3\xb3ng m\xe1\xba\xb7t, m\xe1\xba\xa5t th\xc4\x83ng b\xe1\xba\xb1ng.\\n2.  **Thi\xe1\xba\xbfu m\xc3\xa1u n\xc3\xa3o:** L\xc6\xb0u l\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\xa3ng m\xc3\xa1u l\xc3\xaan n\xc3\xa3o kh\xc3\xb4ng \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\xa7, g\xc3\xa2y \xc4\x91au \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa7u, ch\xc3\xb3ng m\xe1\xba\xb7t.\\n3.  **Tho\xc3\xa1i h\xc3\xb3a \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x91t s\xe1\xbb\x91ng c\xe1\xbb\x95:** G\xc3\xa2y ch\xc3\xa8n \xc3\xa9p d\xc3\xa2y th\xe1\xba\xa7n kinh, g\xc3\xa2y \xc4\x91au v\xc3\xa0 t\xc3\xaa tay ch\xc3\xa2n.\\n4.  **\xc4\x90au n\xe1\xbb\xada \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa7u (Migraine):** \xc4\x90au \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa7u d\xe1\xbb\xaf d\xe1\xbb\x99i, th\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9dng k\xc3\xa8m theo c\xc3\xa1c tri\xe1\xbb\x87u ch\xe1\xbb\xa9ng kh\xc3\xa1c nh\xc6\xb0 nh\xe1\xba\xa1y c\xe1\xba\xa3m v\xe1\xbb\x9bi \xc3\xa1nh s\xc3\xa1ng v\xc3\xa0 \xc3\xa2m thanh.\\n5.  **H\xe1\xba\xa1 huy\xe1\xba\xbft \xc3\xa1p:** Huy\xe1\xba\xbft \xc3\xa1p th\xe1\xba\xa5p c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 g\xc3\xa2y ch\xc3\xb3ng m\xe1\xba\xb7t, m\xe1\xbb\x87t m\xe1\xbb\x8fi.\\n\\nD\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\x9bi \xc4\x91\xc3\xa2y l\xc3\xa0 m\xe1\xbb\x99t s\xe1\xbb\x91 g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m chuy\xc3\xaan khoa th\xe1\xba\xa7n kinh m\xc3\xa0 b\xe1\xba\xa1n c\xc3\xb3 th\xe1\xbb\x83 tham kh\xe1\xba\xa3o:\\n\\n*Hi\xe1\xbb\x87n t\xe1\xba\xa1i kh\xc3\xb4ng c\xc3\xb3 th\xc3\xb4ng tin v\xe1\xbb\x81 c\xc3\xa1c g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m ph\xc3\xb9 h\xe1\xbb\xa3p. Vui l\xc3\xb2ng li\xc3\xaan h\xe1\xbb\x87 tr\xe1\xbb\xb1c ti\xe1\xba\xbfp v\xe1\xbb\x9bi b\xe1\xbb\x87nh vi\xe1\xbb\x87n ho\xe1\xba\xb7c c\xc6\xa1 s\xe1\xbb\x9f y t\xe1\xba\xbf \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\xa3c t\xc6\xb0 v\xe1\xba\xa5n chi ti\xe1\xba\xbft.*\\n\\nDo kh\xc3\xb4ng c\xc3\xb3 g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m ph\xc3\xb9 h\xe1\xbb\xa3p trong d\xe1\xbb\xaf li\xe1\xbb\x87u, b\xe1\xba\xa1n n\xc3\xaan \xc4\x91i kh\xc3\xa1m b\xc3\xa1c s\xc4\xa9 chuy\xc3\xaan khoa th\xe1\xba\xa7n kinh \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x83 \xc4\x91\xc6\xb0\xe1\xbb\xa3c ch\xe1\xba\xa9n \xc4\x91o\xc3\xa1n v\xc3\xa0 t\xc6\xb0 v\xe1\xba\xa5n c\xe1\xbb\xa5 th\xe1\xbb\x83 h\xc6\xa1n v\xe1\xbb\x81 chi ph\xc3\xad kh\xc3\xa1m ch\xe1\xbb\xafa b\xe1\xbb\x87nh.\\n\\n{\\"diseases\\":[\\"R\xe1\xbb\x91i lo\xe1\xba\xa1n ti\xe1\xbb\x81n \xc4\x91\xc3\xacnh\\", \\"Thi\xe1\xba\xbfu m\xc3\xa1u n\xc3\xa3o\\", \\"Tho\xc3\xa1i h\xc3\xb3a \xc4\x91\xe1\xbb\x91t s\xe1\xbb\x91ng c\xe1\xbb\x95\\", \\"\xc4\x90au n\xe1\xbb\xada \xc4\x91\xe1\xba\xa7u\\", \\"H\xe1\xba\xa1 huy\xe1\xba\xbft \xc3\xa1p\\"], \\"packages\\":[], \\"advice_short\\":\\"Kh\xc3\xb4ng t\xc3\xacm th\xe1\xba\xa5y g\xc3\xb3i kh\xc3\xa1m ph\xc3\xb9 h\xe1\xbb\xa3p. N\xc3\xaan kh\xc3\xa1m b\xc3\xa1c s\xc4\xa9 chuy\xc3\xaan khoa th\xe1\xba\xa7n kinh.\\"}\\n"}],"role":"agent"},"state":"working","timestamp":"2025-10-07T06:01:58.737404+00:00"},"taskId":"9d127112-6351-4ef0-998a-581a4efd668e"}}\r\n\r\n'
